  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-label">New &middot; 7 pipelines &middot; New pricing</div>
      <h1>Seven new ways<br>to run your agency.</h1>
      <p>We've rebuilt the CRM around how an estate agency actually runs — seven specialised pipeline boards, a complete rentals workflow, and a fairer way to pay. Everything's live in your account today.</p>
      <a href="https://agents.propertylist.es/new-agent-signup/new" class="btn btn-white">Open PropertyList &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Value -->
  <section class="key-value">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>One board for every part of your business.</h2>
      <p>Each board is a drag-and-drop Kanban. Tag a contact as a Purchaser and they appear on the Buyers board automatically. Mark a deal as Deposit Paid and it slides onto Transactions. <strong>The boards talk to each other — you don't have to.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Feature Grid: 7 boards + done row -->
  <section class="features">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="boards-grid">
        <div class="board">
          <span class="board-icon">&#128229;</span>
          <h3>Leads</h3>
          <p>Every new enquiry, one triage view. Decide who's real, who's a tyre-kicker.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="board">
          <span class="board-icon">&#127968;</span>
          <h3>Buyers</h3>
          <p>Qualified purchasers, from finance verified to offer to completion to post-sale follow-up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="board">
          <span class="board-icon">&#127969;</span>
          <h3>Sellers</h3>
          <p>Vendor journey — valuation, listing signed, marketing, viewings, offers, exchange, completion.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="board">
          <span class="board-icon">&#128273;</span>
          <h3>Tenants</h3>
          <p>Long-term and short-term renters — referencing, deposits, lease, renewals. <em>Rentals module.</em></p>
        </div>
        <div class="board">
          <span class="board-icon">&#127960;</span>
          <h3>Property Lifecycle</h3>
          <p>Your stock prospecting, active, featured, reduced, under offer, sold. Spot stale listings at a glance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="board">
          <span class="board-icon">&#128209;</span>
          <h3>Transactions</h3>
          <p>The legal phase — memorandum, solicitors, mortgage, exchange, completion. Auto-picks up when a deal's agreed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="board">
          <span class="board-icon">&#128155;</span>
          <h3>Nurture</h3>
          <p>Past clients you want to keep warm — anniversaries, referral asks, market updates, re-list opportunities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="board">
          <span class="board-icon">&#10004;</span>
          <h3>Your data is already on the boards</h3>
          <p>Every contact and property is backfilled onto the right pipeline. Nothing to set up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section class="pricing-block">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="label-tag">Pay only when it works</div>
      <h2>Your first 5 conversions are on us.</h2>
      <p>We've replaced all-or-nothing pricing with something fairer. You only pay when a lead becomes a real opportunity — never for the ones that don't.</p>
      <div class="pricing-tiles">
        <div class="tile">
          <span class="tile-num">5 free</span>
          <span class="tile-label">conversions</span>
          <span class="tile-sub">tag your first five Buyers / Sellers / Tenants at zero cost. Forever.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <span class="tile-num">1 credit</span>
          <span class="tile-label">per conversion after that</span>
          <span class="tile-sub">about &euro;1, deducted only when you tag, never for unqualified leads.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="free-note"><strong>Leads</strong>, <strong>Property Lifecycle</strong>, <strong>Transactions</strong> and <strong>Nurture</strong> are unlimited and completely free. No subscription, no lock-in, no minimum spend.</p>
      <a href="https://agents.propertylist.es/new-agent-signup/new" class="btn btn-primary">Start free trial</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Rentals -->
  <section class="rentals">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="rentals-card">
        <h3>Doing rentals? Try the new Rentals module — free for 30 days.</h3>
        <p>Unlocks the Tenants pipeline, a real Tenancies ledger (rent, deposit, dates), Maintenance request tracking, automatic lease-renewal email reminders, and a per-landlord portfolio view. After the trial: 50 credits per 30 days, no auto-charge.</p>
        <a href="https://agents.propertylist.es/new-agent-signup/new" class="btn btn-primary">Start free trial</a>
        <p class="note" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--grey-xlight)">A 60-second interactive tour walks you through the new boards on your first dashboard visit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA bottom -->
  <section class="cta-bottom">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to streamline your sales?</h2>
